{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Brings up the cud (מעלת גרה).</b> From the root גרון, as in 'your throat (גרגרותיך)' — meaning: it brings the food up through the throat after eating it. Another interpretation: from the language of water that flows (מוגרים) — it brings up the food and drink that flow down into the stomach."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:12.202599396Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}